# A landscape's own kind (mechanics pass 3a; BiomeDef.roster `over`): the hauler
# down in the limestone caves works the dark by ear. Held under the target key,
# the slate reads it off the same row it fights by: sees 3, hears 13, a slower
# pace, and a 780 ms tell where the bonelands' hauler tells in 600.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/cave_hauler.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=11
coast calm
wait 0.6
spawn hauler
wait 0.6
hold target
await target 5
wait 0.6
shot 01-the-cave-hauler-read-by-its-own-row with mob:hauler,target
release target
